# Layout

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Base OS/Docker | `ansible/roles/base/` |
| Platform stack | `ansible/roles/platform/` |
| Deploy app | `ansible/roles/deploy_app/`, `ansible/playbooks/deploy-app.yml` |
| Terraform | `terraform/platform/` → `terraform/modules/server/` |
| Prefect | `prefect/<flow>/`, `prefect/prefect.yaml` |
| Tasks | `Taskfile.yml`, `tasks/Taskfile.*.yml` |
| Devcontainer | `.devcontainer/` |
| Roadmap | `docs/future/` |

## Tasks

- `platform:provision:*` — Terraform (`-- <env>`)
- `platform:configure:*` — Ansible server
- `app:deploy` / `app:versions` — `-- <env> <app> <sha>`
- `secrets:*` — keygen, init, sops config
- `server:ssh` / `server:check-status` — `-- <env>`
- `tunnel:start` — dashboard forwards
- `test:run` — lint

`playbooks/server.yml` applies `[base, platform]`.
